01:34:13.782 --> 01:34:14.516
legislation that will help

01:34:14.516 --> 01:34:17.319
families achieve the dream of

01:34:17.319 --> 01:34:18.860
affordable homeownership in san

01:34:18.860 --> 01:34:21.860
francisco in all of california.

01:34:21.222 --> 01:34:21.990
This legislation has strong

01:34:21.990 --> 01:34:24.927
support in the legislature and

01:34:24.927 --> 01:34:25.594
