01:34:25.894 --> 01:34:27.894
haney.

01:34:28.864 --> 01:34:29.565
I hope the governor and the

01:34:29.565 --> 01:34:32.534
rest of the legislature will

01:34:32.534 --> 01:34:33.335
recognize how critical this

01:34:33.335 --> 01:34:36.371
bond measure will be for cities

01:34:36.371 --> 01:34:37.105
like ours and will move forward

01:34:37.105 --> 01:34:37.439
move us forward to the 2026

01:34:37.439 --> 01:34:39.439
ballot.

01:34:40.275 --> 01:34:41.420
I want to thank my colleagues

01:34:41.420 --> 01:34:43.442
supervisors chen chan, dorsey

01:34:44.480 --> 01:34:45.114
melgar, mahmud, sherril fielder

01:34:45.114 --> 01:34:47.283
and guardian walton for

01:34:47.283 --> 01:34:47.983
co-sponsoring this resolution

01:34:47.983 --> 01:34:48.484
and working to create more

01:34:48.484 --> 01:34:50.484
affordable housing

01:34:51.720 --> 01:34:52.321
