01:45:43.814 --> 01:45:44.548
the legislation to our

01:45:44.548 --> 01:45:45.490
attention and working with us

01:45:45.490 --> 01:45:47.490
on the resolution.

01:45:48.286 --> 01:45:49.200
And I want to thank calvin

01:45:49.200 --> 01:45:51.789
in my office for his work on

01:45:51.789 --> 01:45:52.557
this and the rest I submit.

01:45:52.557 --> 01:45:53.224
thank you, MR. PRESIDENT.

